["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"SN 1102: A Strategic Plug Pull - Lessons From a Global Patch-and-Panic Fire Drill PHP to Shell ASLR Patch the Planet unserialize / deserialization coordinated disclosure\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-securitynowaud-php漏洞从未被忽视-只是没人证明过它能被利用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c33ab51a5a5c961-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">2:54:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Security Now (Audio)</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>PHP漏洞從未被忽視，只是沒人證明過它能被利用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這個漏洞2004年就被發現，2020年、2024年的審計又兩次重新撞見，卻因為沒人證明它能被利用而被一再擱置——直到AI用幾天就把它變成了能攻陷70%網站的遠程代碼執行鏈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">PHP</span><span class=\"tag\">漏洞披露</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What&#x27;s Broken About China&#x27;s Economy + The Cost of Keeping China Out | Meg Rithmire mafia firms gray rhino mutual endangerment jiexiaoren anti-involution campaign reverse Tesla\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-chinatalk-别一刀切禁掉中国电动车-方案是复制当年引进特斯拉的打法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd95dc55d0b863a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>別一刀切禁掉中國電動車：方案是複製當年引進特斯拉的打法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國當年靠強制本地化供應鏈和軟硬件分離，把特斯拉變成了本土產業的老師；美國對中國電動車也該這樣做，而不是一禁了之。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中國政治經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">腐敗與治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Anthropic ships the #1 LLM in the World safely: Separating the Brain from the Hands distillation trust grant Claude Managed Agent chain-of-thought extraction brain/hands architecture\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-latentspace-agent安全不是靠堵沙箱漏洞-而是把大脑和手分开放/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>Agent安全不是靠堵沙箱漏洞，而是把大腦和手分開放</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic把執行代理架構拆成常駐服務器上的「大腦」和隨時可銷燬的沙箱「手」，憑證只存在出口網關，agent從未真正碰到過它們，這是意外但最關鍵的安全收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Silicon Valley can’t slow down AI on its own | Luisa Rodriguez chain of thought AI safety levels checkpoint system superintelligence\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-eightythousand-ai公司都想减速-却没人敢先停-对手的ai研究员不休息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/28955397e0f13613-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">21:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>AI公司都想減速，卻沒人敢先停——對手的AI研究員不休息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每一家AI公司都想減速，但沒人敢先停：對手一旦用AI研究員取代人類，暫停一個月換來的可能是被反超幾個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">算力治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The airline CEO putting Starlink on every plane catchment-area flying CASM-X blended wing body Value at Risk (VaR)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-cheekypint-免费从来不是卖点-联合航空靠starlink的速度甩开对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/793e215f9d508567-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>免費從來不是賣點，聯合航空靠Starlink的速度甩開對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">聯合航空重建技術棧後，把Starlink當作兩三年的競爭窗口全力衝刺，目標是趁機會搶下顧客的長期品牌忠誠度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空業</span><span class=\"tag\">Starlink</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing School for the AI Era | Joe Liemandt, Gagan Biyani &amp; Erik Torenberg learning engine magnet marketing brain lift World School\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-a16z-把学校压缩到两小时-50-的学生宁愿上学也不度假/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>把學校壓縮到兩小時：50%的學生寧願上學也不度假</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人用認知科學加LLM把傳統課程學習效率提到兩小時，騰出的時間全部用來教團隊協作、創業和人際關係——這些學校過去從不教的技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">K-12教育</span><span class=\"tag\">另類教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Cliff Sosin - Owning the Complements to Intelligence - [Invest Like the Best, EP.497] Jevons Paradox complements to intelligence diamond-shaped demand frontier vibe coding freestyle chess\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-ilt-智能终将免费-最值钱的是数据和注意力-不是模型本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6e8b9b39215b98db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>智能終將免費：最值錢的是數據和注意力，不是模型本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的核心判斷是：智能會變得近乎免費，所以不該押注造算力和模型的公司，而該押注智能替代不了的數據、注意力和物理場景。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投資框架</span><span class=\"tag\">智能的互補品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Lindsey Fitzharris &amp; The Sleuth-Hound optography Penny Bloods expert witness thief takers\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-tpwky-福尔摩斯作者恨透了这个角色-原型却是真实苏格兰医生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>福爾摩斯作者恨透了這個角色，原型卻是真實蘇格蘭醫生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柯南道爾曾想殺掉福爾摩斯以擺脫這個角色，但正是愛丁堡解剖教室裡那位教他「讀病人」的外科醫生貝爾，給了這個偵探全部的血肉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福爾摩斯</span><span class=\"tag\">法醫學史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"295: Situated: How Your Choices Today Shape Your Child&#x27;s Tomorrow | Angela Duckworth Three-box model fundamental attribution error food desert situational responsibility\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-asklisa-改变行为靠的不是意志力-而是换个处境/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d7c3fcaede22fdb0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">42:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>改變行為靠的不是意志力，而是換個處境</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理學家 Angela Duckworth 用自己差點離婚的婚姻和一套三步模型說明：比起死磕意志力或硬扭想法，改變所處的環境往往更省力也更有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年養育</span><span class=\"tag\">行為改變</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Your Kid Needs Someone Who Isn’t You, with Chelsea Handler marble jar\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-27-goodinside-孩子最需要的不是父母-而是一个不会审判他们的局外人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1027</span></div>\n<h2>孩子最需要的不是父母，而是一個不會審判他們的局外人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她不是父母，卻因為沒有日常育兒的消耗，反而能提供父母難以維持的無條件穩定陪伴，孩子因此越來越值得信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">養育</span><span class=\"tag\">信任建立</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Montague Summers Anglo-Catholicism Uranian verse Order of Chaeronea Malleus Maleficarum\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-stuffmissed-写遍女巫与吸血鬼的-神父-终身未必真正受过圣职/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>寫遍女巫與吸血鬼的「神父」，終身未必真正受過聖職</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蒙塔古·薩默斯用一己之力把獵巫手冊、吸血鬼傳說搬進英語學術界，卻終身沒能找到任何確鑿證據證明他真的被天主教會授予聖職。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獵巫史</span><span class=\"tag\">吸血鬼傳說</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI: When AI Agents Use Computers Faster Than You Computer Use (CUA) WebMCP Guardian Dots Atlas\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-a16z-openai的电脑操作ai已比普通人快-正逼近超越专家水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">45:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI的電腦操作AI已比普通人快，正逼近超越專家水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI的產品負責人說，其電腦操作agent已比普通人用電腦快，正逼近專家水平；比起造新軟件替換老系統，他們更想讓agent直接接管企業現有的遺留軟件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Computer Use</span><span class=\"tag\">企業自動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Agents Are Already Changing the Price of Goods agentic commerce surveillance pricing / personalized pricing dynamic pricing fiduciary duty K-shaped economy Alternative Profits Book of Business\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-oddlots-号称替你省钱的购物ai-查完钱包后挑贵的买/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>號稱替你省錢的購物AI，查完錢包後挑貴的買</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">325,000個agent實驗顯示：即使被要求找最低價，AI助手摸清你的收入水平後，仍會帶回更貴的選項。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算法定價</span><span class=\"tag\">代理電商</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Charles de Gaulle: The Man Who Rebuilt France Appeal of 18 June Fifth Republic RPF (Rassemblement du Peuple Français) Free French\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-historyhit-戴高乐逃亡时既无军队也无政府授权-靠的全是自信/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b0e3b943fd96a11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>戴高樂逃亡時既無軍隊也無政府授權，靠的全是自信</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1940年他軍銜僅是准將，幾乎沒人認識他，卻憑一己之力宣布法國沒有輸掉戰爭——這份自信後來撐起了他兩度執掌法國的全部政治資本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法國史</span><span class=\"tag\">戴高樂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"717. The Suez Crisis: Anarchy in the Middle East (Part 1) Suez Canal Zone Free Officers Baghdad Pact Operation Musketeer Pan-Arabism FLN\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-restishistory-苏伊士运河被收归国有完全合法-英国首相还是执意开战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17d882602bc2f63b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>蘇伊士運河被收歸國有完全合法，英國首相還是執意開戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">納賽爾按股價足額賠償了運河公司股東，國際法上無可指摘；但伊登認定他是「新墨索里尼」,寧願賭上帝國顏面也要動武推翻他。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘇伊士運河危機</span><span class=\"tag\">大英帝國衰落</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"407. JFK: The Kennedy Curse Begins (Part 1) Irish switch Brahmins PT boat Muckers Club final club\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-26-empirehist-外界以为哥哥战死才让肯尼迪从政-其实他早有此意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">52:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1026</span></div>\n<h2>外界以為哥哥戰死才讓肯尼迪從政，其實他早有此意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歷史學家洛格瓦爾說，1942年與情人的枕邊話證明肯尼迪在哥哥戰死前就已瞄準總統之位，哥哥的死只是加速了這條路，而非創造了它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪家族</span><span class=\"tag\">美國政治史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Lintel Conquest of UNIX Lintel GPL Active Directory IA-64 / Itanium distro\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-asianometry-打垮-unix-的不是-windows-而是-intel-扶持的-linux/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c89d1667eef4960d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>打垮 UNIX 的不是 Windows,而是 Intel 扶持的 Linux</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">UNIX 陣營靠專有硬件和操作系統把客戶鎖死多年，Intel 先用 Windows NT 撬開缺口，但真正要命的是免費、能看源碼、不怕被鎖死的 Linux。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Linux</span><span class=\"tag\">UNIX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An 86-minute guide to finding PMF | Rob Snyder (Author, The Power of Pull) PULL framework Hail Mary question Goblin mode Design partner\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-lennys-好产品不是说服出来的-是发现客户已经卡住的那件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de7a163b06c13a51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>好產品不是說服出來的，是發現客戶已經卡住的那件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人常以為要靠說服讓客戶買單，Rob的核心論斷是：拉力早就存在於客戶的待辦清單裡，你的工作只是去發現那個會把產品從你手裡搶走的人，而不是創造渴望。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品市場契合</span><span class=\"tag\">早期銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Podcast: Kimi K3.1 Pro, the new cyber reality, and Muse musings astroturfing abliterated model B300 / NVL72 PHP2Shell\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-interconnects-php漏洞公开后无人作恶-网络安全瓶颈不是ai而是没人打补丁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0c99c5f34972836e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">46:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>PHP漏洞公開後無人作惡：網絡安全瓶頸不是AI而是沒人打補丁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi主動壓低自身攻擊能力以示負責；PHP高危漏洞曝光後預期的大規模黑客利用並未出現——瓶頸是企業幾年不打補丁，而非AI能力強弱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Startup Playbook | Box CEO Aaron Levie context rot spec-driven development sub agent TAM go-to-market PLG\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-a16z-创业公司能跑赢大公司-不是因为技术-而是组织换不动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>創業公司能跑贏大公司，不是因為技術，而是組織換不動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大公司人多但流程早已固化、改不動，創業公司沒有歷史包袱，能立刻把agent接進工作流——這是AI第一次讓以小博大在經濟上真正可行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業方法論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1369: Florida Model Makes Measles Great Again VHIT (vaccine-induced herd immunity threshold) vaccination reproduction number (R_v) HLA class I CTL epitope founder effect escape mutation / epitope variant\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-twiv-佛州还没取消疫苗强制令-麻疹就已经跌破群体免疫线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:57:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>佛州還沒取消疫苗強制令，麻疹就已經跌破群體免疫線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">佛州兒童疫苗接種率只有91.6%,已經低於阻斷麻疹所需閾值；取消強制令後接種率或跌到82%,麻疹將在十年內變成持續50年的地方病。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bronze Age Syria: Cradle of Cities Amorite Hurrian cuneiform vassal king Mitanni\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-25-ancients-叙利亚不是帝国争霸的过道-而是人类最早和平条约的诞生地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/443cfc236f2ce59c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1025</span></div>\n<h2>敘利亞不是帝國爭霸的過道，而是人類最早和平條約的誕生地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公元前2300年埃卜拉與鄰國簽下的條約裡，連「信使等超過十天要管飯」這種細節都寫明瞭——外交規則那時就已成熟，敘利亞是規則的發明者，不是夾縫中的通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代近東</span><span class=\"tag\">外交史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Eleanor of Aquitaine | Extra History Complete | European History Angevin Empire The Anarchy devil&#x27;s brood\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-extracredits-埃莉诺煽动儿子叛乱是传说-史料显示她当时根本不在场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b240ed2c2cbee729-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">35:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>埃莉諾煽動兒子叛亂是傳說：史料顯示她當時根本不在場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果埃莉諾真的在幕後操縱兒子叛亂，亨利大概率會直接休了她、把她關得更慘——她更像是宮廷方便甩鍋的替罪羊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀史</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Dead Printers Tell No Tales PKI Root of Trust (ROT) HSM M-of-N key splitting tamper-evident packaging Secure Boot / Verified Boot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-24-oxideandfriend-防拆袋没拆对-oxide-连夜重做整套根密钥签发仪式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09bb50f19f9b4357-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1024</span></div>\n<h2>防拆袋沒拆對，Oxide 連夜重做整套根密鑰簽發儀式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Oxide 工程師開車回家路上越想越不安，調頭回公司親手測試防拆袋，發現自己能神不知鬼不覺地重新封口，於是帶著儀式團隊連夜把整套根密鑰簽發流程重做了一遍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">PKI</span><span class=\"tag\">信任根</span>\n</div></div></a>"]